{"id": "131499", "name": "מציאת פולינום על פי ערכיו בנקודות", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "(", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "randpoly", "params": ["deg", "n", "x"], "body": "block([poly],poly: 0,for i:0 thru deg do(poly: poly + rand_with_step(-n,n,1)*x^i),poly)"}, {"name": "polyfunc", "params": ["x"], "body": "subst(x,a,poly)"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתון פולינום <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P(x)\\)</span> ממעלה לכל היותר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(3\\)</span> כך ש-</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(P({{CT:0}})={{CT:1}}\\)</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(P({{CT:2}})={{CT:3}}\\)</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(P({{CT:4}})={{CT:5}}\\)</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(P({{CT:6}})={{CT:7}}\\)</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>נסמן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P(x)=a+b\\cdot x+ c\\cdot x^2+d\\cdot x^3\\)</span>. מצאו את מקדמי הפולינום <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a,b,c,d\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(a=\\) [[input:ans0]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(b=\\) [[input:ans1]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(c=\\) [[input:ans2]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(d=\\) [[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans0]] [[validation:ans1]] [[validation:ans2]] [[validation:ans3]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">רמז: הציבו ערכים לפולינום וקבלו מערכת משוואות במקדמי הפולינום כמשתנים.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans0", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "correctans: is([ans0,ans1,ans2,ans3]=cofs)", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "correctans", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך נכונה</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך אינה נכונה.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["cofs", "inputs", "outputs", "poly"], "nvariants": 50}